# Customer Churn Prediction Using Supervised Machine Learning and Explainable AI

End-to-end machine learning project that predicts which telecom customers are likely to leave, using the IBM Telco Customer Churn dataset. It covers exploratory analysis, feature engineering, class imbalance handling, four tuned models, threshold analysis, and SHAP-based interpretation.

